{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Isekai Captain",
    "steam_appid": 3505660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/d4124d255a182b7b347d879a08e89eb2.avif?t=1753675810\" width=614 height=140 /></span>&quot;Isekai Captain&quot; is a 2D fantasy cartoon-style light rogue-lite strategy game. You will play as a captain in another world, leading a team to battle against the demon army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Gameplay Modes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode (In Development):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand strategy mode with a world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your towns, cut off enemy supply lines, assassinate elite demons, and seize strategic points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully and advance step by step to ultimately lead your army to the Demon King's lair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bridge Defense Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling strategy/TD hybrid with 30 waves (expanding to 50 in future updates). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command and upgrade 4 squads (20 units total). Victory requires mastering game mechanics and showcasing your tactical team composition and leadership skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 5 level 1 characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and command them to endure the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can customize their characters' race, appearance, starting class, and initial weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.poster.avif?t=1753675810\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.webm?t=1753675810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.mp4?t=1753675810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starting Classes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior, Hunter, Scholar (in development), and Cleric (in development).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Classes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Dozens of advanced classes are available for promotion, each with unique traits, offering endless team-building possibilities. Examples include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord, Mercenary, Champion, Knight, Ranger, Assassin, Swordmaster,  Greatsword Fighter, Berserker, Shield Guard, Spear Guard, Heavy Knight, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/0cb3cc6b3ab07d620ab783ae8fa9699b.avif?t=1753675810\" width=615 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-Handed Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with left-click and issue commands with right-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters automatically attack when near enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teammates are AI-controlled, following the player and dodging some attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light Rogue-Lite Elements:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can level up to 20.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon leveling up, draw 4 skill cards from a pool to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 95% probability, you can build your character as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Meta Progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on in-game progression, offering a rich and diverse experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapon and class combinations are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must explore the vast promotion system to build their dream fantasy team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/d4124d255a182b7b347d879a08e89eb2.avif?t=1753675810\" width=614 height=140 /></span>&quot;Isekai Captain&quot; is a 2D fantasy cartoon-style light rogue-lite strategy game. You will play as a captain in another world, leading a team to battle against the demon army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Gameplay Modes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode (In Development):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand strategy mode with a world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your towns, cut off enemy supply lines, assassinate elite demons, and seize strategic points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully and advance step by step to ultimately lead your army to the Demon King's lair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bridge Defense Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling strategy/TD hybrid with 30 waves (expanding to 50 in future updates). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command and upgrade 4 squads (20 units total). Victory requires mastering game mechanics and showcasing your tactical team composition and leadership skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 5 level 1 characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and command them to endure the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can customize their characters' race, appearance, starting class, and initial weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.poster.avif?t=1753675810\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.webm?t=1753675810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/6944e70b92edd25b3e02fdd736cbab5c.mp4?t=1753675810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starting Classes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior, Hunter, Scholar (in development), and Cleric (in development).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Classes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Dozens of advanced classes are available for promotion, each with unique traits, offering endless team-building possibilities. Examples include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord, Mercenary, Champion, Knight, Ranger, Assassin, Swordmaster,  Greatsword Fighter, Berserker, Shield Guard, Spear Guard, Heavy Knight, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505660/extras/0cb3cc6b3ab07d620ab783ae8fa9699b.avif?t=1753675810\" width=615 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-Handed Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with left-click and issue commands with right-click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters automatically attack when near enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teammates are AI-controlled, following the player and dodging some attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light Rogue-Lite Elements:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can level up to 20.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon leveling up, draw 4 skill cards from a pool to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 95% probability, you can build your character as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Meta Progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on in-game progression, offering a rich and diverse experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapon and class combinations are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must explore the vast promotion system to build their dream fantasy team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Isekai Captain&quot; is a 2D fantasy Roguelike where you lead a squad against demons. Customize your hero, choose classes like Warrior or Hunter, and unlock advanced roles. Explore Kalan, grow your team, and stop the Demon King\u2019s awakening in this epic adventure!",
